Package: kilix-needle
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, kilix-content, kilix-ml, kilix-transcript-clean, kilix-tui-utils, ${misc:Depends}
Description: plain requests to Kilix
 kilix-needle turns a request into one Kilix job. This package installs
 the command and its runtime under /usr/share/kilix-needle.
 The command model is not included; kilix-needle install downloads it
 on first use. Catalog, tuning, transcript, and rollout libraries come
 from their own packages.
